  "body": "Freehold 842 sqm land area (more or less).\r\nDesigned, stylish, two-level family home\r\nSchool zone: Bucklands Beach Primary, BBI and Macleans College;\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n*\t4 bedrooms (1 ensuite included), 2 bathrooms, \r\n*\tModern kitchen and spacious living room,\r\n*\tSpacious outdoor living space,\r\n*\tBig decking and double garage,\r\n*\tClose proximity to both Bucklands' and Eastern Beach.\r\n*\tHandy to convenience shopping and bus route,\r\n*\tPositioned on one of the most prestigious streets in the Bucklands Beach Peninsula,\r\n\r\nEnjoy the renowned East Auckland coastal lifestyle - stroll to nearby beaches, parks, and cafes, or take advantage of the top school zones and strong community feel.\r\nContact us today to learn more about this exceptional property.",
